items: v3-new-parsed-as-a-name
paths: file:v3/src/Parser.scala
scope: |
  throw new RuntimeException(boom) parses as (bin RuntimeException (name new) …) —
  new is not a keyword, so the alphanumeric-infix rule takes the class name as an
  operator. UniML gives the plain call. Drop new before a constructor.
